rier at the host boundary so no raw host double crosses a guest frame.\n   - `+`, `-`, `*`, unary `-`, unary `+`, `/`, `//`, `%`, `**`, and `<`/`<=`/`>`/`>=` delegate directly to boxed `yin.vm.float` exports (`float/add`, `float/sub`, `float/mul`, `float/neg`, `float/div-checked`, `float/floordiv-mod`, `float/fpow-half`, `float/neg-pow`, `float/compare`) and `integer/compare-float` (via boxed float helper).\n576:      (throw (ex-info \"data module needs an explicit max-items\"\n577:                      {::reason :limits, ::limit ::max-items})))))\n580:(defn register-data-module\n584:   Under `limits`, the module also exports `max-items`, of no arguments,\n585:   answering the composition's `::max-items`: the largest item or\n587:   profile checks it before it builds). `::max-items` must be a positive\n595:   (let [n (::max-items limits)]\n599:              'max-items (arity-checked 'max-items [0] (fn [] n)))\n601:              'max-items (vm/primitive-profile 'max-items :pure [0] #{}\n189:  [:yin.k/profile :yin.k/class :yin.k/arities :yin.k/effects\n261:                                            [sym (:yin.k/profile\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
